# Normalise line endings so that history stays readable.
#
# core.autocrlf=true is set on this machine, which makes git convert LF to
# CRLF on every checkout.  Scripts that rewrite a file in place therefore
# rewrite the *whole* file with a line-ending change, and the diff for a
# one-paragraph edit reads as "5563 insertions, 5415 deletions" when it is
# really 57.
#
# The repository stores LF.  Declare it, so that a tool that writes CRLF
# does not turn a paragraph edit into a whole-file diff.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.bin binary
*.elf binary
*.prx binary